        <i class="fas fa-bars" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <div class="ytv-dropdown" id="dropdownMenu" role="menu" aria-label="Menu">
            @* Nhom 1 - loai co so: CHI hien tren dien thoai. Tu tablet tro len da
               co san o sidebar than trang nen an di, khoi lap. *@
            <div class="ytv-dropdown-coso">
                <a href="/Home/DanhSachCoSo-benhvien" role="menuitem">
